Wiring (D1 R32):

    ULN2003 IN1, IN2, IN3, IN4 go to GPIO 25, 26, 27 and 14.

    KY-032 S goes to GPIO 16 (D5), with its power from 3V3.

    Motor + goes to 5V.

Serial commands (115200 baud, newline-terminated):

    The belt runs until the sensor sees a box, then stops and prints BOX.

    GO moves about 40 mm to clear the sensor and resumes.

    GO <mm> moves that distance, prints DONE, and waits.

    RUN resumes the belt, and STOP halts it.